<title>FRANCE: French bonds close touch higher in quiet market.</title>
<headline>French bonds close touch higher in quiet market.</headline>
<text>
<p>1620 GMT - Bond futures close fraction firmer in becalmed market, above resistance 128.94. Bank of France left intervention rate unchanged at 3.15 percent, as expected.</p>
<p>*Mar 10-yr future 129.00, up 0.10. Vol 8,651. High 129.00.</p>
<p>*6.50 2006 OAT yield 5.74 pct unch.</p>
<p>*Call money unch at 3-3/16 5/16. Mar PIBOR 96.68 unch.</p>
</text>
